### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### 任务列表（端侧首页用）
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tasks

### 任务详情
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/tasks/T-1001

### 设备台账
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/devices/D-3001

### 纯 JSON 上报（无图）
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/inspections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskId": "T-1001",
  "deviceId": "D-3001",
  "deviceName": "3号低压配电柜",
  "voiceText": "接头有点烫，闻到轻微焦味",
  "location": "A区配电房",
  "sensor": { "temperature": 78.5, "humidity": 62, "simulated": false }
}

### 工单列表
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/workorders
